---
source: crates/mydiff-tui/src/view.rs
expression: "screen(&app(LEFT, RIGHT, 100, 24))"
---
" left.txt                          right.txt                       commands                         "
"   1 alpha                           1 alpha                      │ Navigate                        "
"   2 beta                       -                                 │ j/k     down / up               "
"   3 gamma                           2 gamma                      │ PgDn/Up page down / up          "
"   4 delta                      ~    3 delta changed              │ g/G     top / bottom            "
"                                +    4 zeta                       │ n/p     next / prev change      "
"   5 epsilon                         5 epsilon                    │ h/l     scroll left / right     "
"                                                                  │                                 "
"                                                                  │ Compare                         "
"                                                                  │ w       whitespace        exact "
"                                                                  │ i       ignore case         off "
"                                                                  │ b       ignore blank lines  off "
"                                                                  │ e       ignore line endings  on "
"                                                                  │                                 "
"                                                                  │ View                            "
"                                                                  │ u       layout     side-by-side "
"                                                                  │                                 "
"                                                                  │ General                         "
"                                                                  │ Tab     toggle this sidebar     "
"                                                                  │ Tab ←/→ dock left / right       "
"                                                                  │ ?       toggle help             "
"                                                                  │ q/Esc   quit or go back         "
"                                                                  │ Ctrl-c  quit from anywhere      "
" [w]s:exact [i]case:… -1 +1 ~1  2 changes  tab:keys ?:help q:quit │                                 "
